摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"AWiki identity and messaging plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1334428397","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-awiki","slug":"AgentConnect/dsh-awiki","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"AWiki identity and messaging plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @awiki/dsh-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"AWiki account, authorization, recovery, and messaging for\nDeepSeek Harness. The package installs one"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" Host\nservice, its IM Core provider, the model tools, and a Web client with a draggable AWiki Me lau"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ncher.\nGeneral DID documents and private keys are managed by the independent\n`@agent-network-protoco"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"l/dsh-anp-identity` plugin and injected through Cordis."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Identity-entry failures preserve the currently mounted form and local pending identity material. The"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"\nphone and OTP never enter browser persistence, controller snapshots, or public\nRemote results. Clos"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ed registration, unavailable verification state, and commit conflicts each give\na safe next action w"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ithout exposing remote response details. The exact Node error\n`short_handle_invite_required` returns"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" registration to the editable identity form and shows the fixed\ninvitation notice; neither Handle le"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ngth nor remote error text selects that UI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The two plugins deliberately own different state. ANP Identity owns the multi-DID Store, DID\ndocumen"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ts, private keys, and publication transactions. AWiki IM Core owns Handle/account bindings,\ndevice a"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"nd recovery workflows, authentication tokens, messages, mail, SQLite, and caches below its\nconfigure"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"d `stateRoot`. The Host-only provider lease is never exposed to Browser, Remote, Agent\ntools, or mod"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"Root`. The Host-only provider lease is never exposed to Browser, Remote, Agent\ntools, or model APIs."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Select a Core-advertised identity method (WBA by default, or Web when enabled), then enter a Handl"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"e and phone through one Web UI flow and always request a registration OTP. A new Handle creates the "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"deployment identity; an existing Handle offers ordinary Device Join first. Choosing Recovery V4 open"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"s a separate destructive-impact page without cancelling Join or sending an OTP; only its second expl"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"icit “replace DID” action cancels the pending choice and requests a purpose-scoped recovery OTP.\n- D"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"SH can join an existing Handle as an independent member device. When DSH created or recovered the Ha"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"ndle and is the current ready-admin, the foreground Devices tab can list devices, verify an incoming"},{"id":"p8s8","text":" request with SAS, approve one member, reject it, or revoke another device. These mutations are not "},{"id":"p8s9","text":"Agent tools and require explicit `APPROVE` / `REVOKE` confirmation.\n- A local Darwin x64 WBA ready-a"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"dmin can prepare Root Transfer for one exact active member and use native system authentication befo"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"re sending management capability. Authorization handles and Root material remain Host/Core-only; uns"},{"id":"p8s12","text":"upported or headless Hosts fail closed. A recovered old device uses the same native-authentication s"},{"id":"p8s13","text":"eam to re-Join only as a member.\n- Open the top-left AWiki account menu to sign out locally without "},{"id":"p8s14","text":"deleting the encrypted identity or message database; **Resume local identity** restores the same DID"},{"id":"p8s15","text":" and Handle, including across DSH restarts. The signed-out screen reveals phone recovery only after "},{"id":"p8s16","text":"local resume fails. Switching identities requires an explicit confirmation that permanently clears l"},{"id":"p8s17","text":"ocal AWiki data first.\n- Reuse that identity across the root Agent and its subagents.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Messaging"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Mail"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Browser-selected attachments use Host-authenticated HTTP (`mail.send` / `mail.getAttachment` on `/ma"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"il/rpc`), with no new IM Core attachment API. Up to 10 files can be selected. The current signing AP"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"I accepts at most 4 MiB per request: the effective decoded upload limit is 2.625 MiB per file and in"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" total (or a lower configured limit), reserving room for Base64 and JSON metadata. Downloads support"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" up to 10 MiB per file. The UI obtains these limits from Host. Send confirmation lists filenames and"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" sizes; attachment sends are never automatically replayed, including authentication retries."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Download responses are bounded before JSON parsing and validated against attachment index, safe file"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"name, MIME type, canonical Base64 and decoded size; Browser also verifies the Host SHA-256 against t"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"he selected metadata. Inbox and sent downloads use the authoritative service message ID. Pending ope"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"rations are fenced on identity or tenant changes. File selections remain only in owner/tenant-scoped"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" process memory across drawer remounts, never in persistent browser storage. Agent tools remain plai"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ory across drawer remounts, never in persistent browser storage. Agent tools remain plain-text-only."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Host options `mailAttachmentMaxCount`, `mailAttachmentMaxBytes` and `mailAttachmentTotalMaxBytes` ma"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"y lower the service limits; the effective upload budget is additionally clamped to the signing trans"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"port limit. `mailAttachmentMaxBytes` also bounds downloads."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The first release does not implement end-to-end encryption, multiple identities,\npost-creation group"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" administration or multiple attachments in one message. The Agent listener accepts only\nplain Direct"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" text; Groups, attachments, encrypted/payload content, and unknown slash commands never\nreach the Ag"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"t; Groups, attachments, encrypted/payload content, and unknown slash commands never\nreach the Agent."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Mail v1 provides an on-demand browser mailbox/compose UI and five on-demand Agent tools. Inbox uses\n"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"the existing Core inbound query; sent uses a fixed Host-only, current-identity-authenticated\n`mail.l"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ist(direction=outbound)` query. The identity-scoped browser cache may keep the last visible\npage dur"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ing an explicit refresh error, but it is never sent-history authority. A successful send is\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Install the independent identity plugin first, then AWiki:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The main package no longer installs the AWiki-hosted model provider. Add the\nindependently versioned"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" Model Proxy package only when that capability is wanted:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The profile installer both adds the package and activates its bundle layer. A\nplain `npm i @awiki/ds"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"h-plugin` in a DSH project only installs the package; it\ndoes not activate the bundle, so the profil"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"e command remains the recommended\ninstallation path. This release line targets the `0.1.5-rc.1` pack"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"age family\nand pins every direct Host peer exactly, preventing npm from mixing prerelease\nfamilies i"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"n a DSH root dependency tree."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`@awiki/dsh-plugin` is the canonical package identity starting with\n`0.2.0-rc.4`. The former `@awiki"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"/dsh` registry entry was unpublished and is\nnot an installation source for this release line."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Do not commit OTPs, access tokens, private keys, identity state, `.env` files, or\nremote-test report"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"s. `pnpm check:public` enforces the public-tree guard before\nverification and packaging."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
